<div id="Ch4.S2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ch4.S2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Although written in Python/NumPy for clarity, the implementation is fully
compatible with multidimensional FFT backends and parallel hardware
architectures, as discussed in Chapter 6.</p>
</div>
